=\"strong\">Protecting My Company's Intellectual Property</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p><strong>Instructions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Write a 3-paragraph text describing the importance of intellectual property in your company.</li>\n<li>First, make an introductory paragraph on intellectual property.</li>\n<li>Second, write a paragraph describing the advantages and disadvantages of IP for your company.</li>\n<li>Finally, make a conclusion paragraph. &nbsp;</li>\n<li>Don&rsquo;t forget to give examples to clarify any information you provide</li>\n<li>Remember to use connectors and cohesive devices.</li>\n<li>Don&rsquo;t use informal language.</li>\n</ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br />When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button.<br /><br /><span class=\"strong\">IP in my company</span>"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Activity 3"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "You're done!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "It's time to review your descriptive text.<br /><br />\nWhen you are writing your essay, remember to include:\n<br /><br /><ul>\n<li>A title\n<li>Examples \n<li>Connectors and cohesive devices</ul>\n<br />Proofread your essay for any spelling, grammar or punctuation errors.\n<br /><Read your essay aloud to a partner.\n<br />Click the <span class=\"strong\">Submit</span> button to save your work.\n"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"grading_contents": {"body": {"rows": [{"